      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Regular land tax, in rice (Sanuki), five-year average: 4,000.82626 koku. SCAN OVERRIDES MASTER: MASTER reads 四千八石八斗二升六合二勺六才 = 4,008.82626, but the column holds exactly 14 value glyphs — one fewer than that reading needs — and at 9x the 石 clearly precedes the 八, which is the 斗 digit. MASTER's leading 八 is a phantom insertion; the integer part is 四千 = 4,000."
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "正租米"
